  "reasoning": "The defendants organized a scheme to obtain others' credit cards and related personal information, then sold or transferred these cards to an upstream buyer. The conduct matches the statutory offense of illegally acquiring, buying, and providing credit card information, which is termed “收买、非法提供他人信用卡信息罪”. There is no factual basis for contract fraud or bill fraud, so only this charge applies.",
  "final_answer": "[收买、非法提供他人信用卡信息罪]"
}

